{"1413270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call From The Deep", "steam_appid": 1413270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call From The Deep is a gripping first-person co-op horror experience. Team up with up to 8 friends to crew a submarine and dive into the haunted abyss of an otherworldly ocean. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the sprawling seaside port of Mursk, a gritty city forged by ruthless industrial greed and shadowy occult forces, the game centers on perilous expeditionary runs into the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your submarine to handcrafted locations, each a sprawling level to delve: forgotten ancient ruins, graveyards of lost shipwrecks, and derelict industrial outposts built by Mursk's elite. Scavenge vital resources to repair and upgrade your vessel, equip unique diving masks that unlock specialized perks, battle nightmarish anomalies, and claim priceless artifacts from the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silver Sea teems with unpredictable aberrations. Psychic storms that shatter sanity. Colossal leviathans capable of crushing your hull in one savage strike. No two descents are alike, every descent will be unique in where, when, and how you'll encounter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way is down. There is no safe harbor in the deep — every fathom you claim into the crushing black raises both the horror and the reward. Descend for fortune and glory... or become another name lost to the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend for fortune and glory... or become another name lost to the tide.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/fdf2020ae9c08007da4bbed0d7ad3fe5.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call From The Deep is a gripping first-person co-op horror experience. Team up with up to 8 friends to crew a submarine and dive into the haunted abyss of an otherworldly ocean. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the sprawling seaside port of Mursk, a gritty city forged by ruthless industrial greed and shadowy occult forces, the game centers on perilous expeditionary runs into the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/b177499232f7064debb70a411671925e.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your submarine to handcrafted locations, each a sprawling level to delve: forgotten ancient ruins, graveyards of lost shipwrecks, and derelict industrial outposts built by Mursk's elite. Scavenge vital resources to repair and upgrade your vessel, equip unique diving masks that unlock specialized perks, battle nightmarish anomalies, and claim priceless artifacts from the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/649b95d7abce02d6488fab83b7db77f3.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silver Sea teems with unpredictable aberrations. Psychic storms that shatter sanity. Colossal leviathans capable of crushing your hull in one savage strike. No two descents are alike, every descent will be unique in where, when, and how you'll encounter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.poster.avif?t=1783396234\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.webm?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/extras/6cbf81d416ba2831cdbdaf3d9c25c58d.mp4?t=1783396234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way is down. There is no safe harbor in the deep — every fathom you claim into the crushing black raises both the horror and the reward. Descend for fortune and glory... or become another name lost to the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend for fortune and glory... or become another name lost to the tide.</p>", "short_description": "Call From The Deep is a gripping first-person co-op horror experience. Crew a submarine with up to 8 friends and descend into a haunted abyss. Patch the leaks, fend off nightmares, and hold the hull together as you dive ever deeper — for fortune and glory, or be lost to the tide.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/36d072e405b2e8a987480993169535b247f080f0/header.jpg?t=1783396234", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/b23abdbe622e9b167409c3e64b2b83e3e0167d0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783396234", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1413270/b23abdbe622e9b167409c3e64b2b83e3e0167d0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783396234", "website": "https://www.callfromthedeep.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<b